L["The frame rate at most while the map is open (0: off). A big map draws many layers over the whole screen every frame; 60 halves the graphics card's work at 120 fps, for a smooth enough map. The game's own frame rate setting comes back as the map closes."] = "打开地图时的最高帧数（0：关闭）。大地图每一帧都要在整个屏幕上绘制许多图层；在120帧时设为60可让显卡的工作量减半，地图依然足够流畅。关闭地图时恢复游戏自身的帧数设置。"
