L["With Questie, Dungeon Journal or NeedRoll, this dungeon's quests are here."] = "安装Questie、Dungeon Journal或NeedRoll后，这里会显示该地下城的任务。"
L["With a gamepad, that map opens once you're out of combat."] = "使用手柄时，该地图将在你脱离战斗后打开。"
L["With the game's Gamepad UI on, OpenMap's map instead of Blizzard's. The controller's B and full-screen buttons on the map are OpenMap's then, so the game doesn't block them. Still being tried out: if the game blocks something, turn this off and /reload."] = "手柄界面启用时，使用OpenMap的地图代替暴雪的地图。此时地图上手柄的B键和全屏键由OpenMap接管，游戏不会阻止它们。仍在测试中：如果游戏阻止了某些操作，请关闭此项并输入/reload。"
L["WoW Forever has no map of this dungeon yet."] = "WoW Forever还没有这个地下城的地图。"
L["World map: Blizzard's map isn't the expected kind; the seamless map is off."] = "世界地图：暴雪的地图不是预期的类型；无缝地图已关闭。"
L["World map: Blizzard's map layers aren't the expected ones; the stitched art may cover some map icons."] = "世界地图：暴雪的地图图层与预期不符；拼接的地图图像可能会遮挡部分地图图标。"
L["World map: townsfolk and rare mobs come from Questie's database. Install and enable Questie to see them."] = "世界地图：镇民和稀有怪物来自Questie的数据库。安装并启用Questie即可看到它们。"
L["World map: townsfolk and rares need Questie's database, which isn't available."] = "世界地图：镇民和稀有怪物需要Questie的数据库，但当前无法使用。"
L["You aren't on the world map here (an instance or a place it doesn't cover)."] = "你所在的位置不在世界地图上（副本中，或地图未覆盖的地方）。"
L["You can change any of it later in OpenMap's menu (its button on the map, or /openmap)."] = "之后可以随时在OpenMap的菜单中更改（点击地图上的按钮，或输入/openmap）。"
L["Your arrow"] = "你的箭头"
L["Your buttons"] = "你的按钮"
L["Your drawings"] = "你的绘图"
L["Your guild (those with OpenMap are asked whether to add it)."] = "你的公会（装有OpenMap的玩家会被询问是否添加）。"
L["Your own arrow on the world map. Off, you find your way old-school, by the land around you; your party still shows, and so does the minimap."] = "你在世界地图上的箭头。关闭后，你得像老玩家那样靠周围的地形认路；队友仍会显示，小地图也照常可用。"
L["Your party or raid (those with OpenMap are asked whether to add it)."] = "你的小队或团队（装有OpenMap的玩家会被询问是否添加）。"
L["Zeppelin"] = "飞艇"
L["Zeppelin towers (click one: the other end), and zeppelins' routes when routes are shown."] = "飞艇塔（点击一个：前往另一端），显示航线时也显示飞艇的航线。"
L["Zeppelins"] = "飞艇"
L["Zone"] = "区域"
L["Zone highlight on hover"] = "悬停时高亮区域"
L["Zone levels"] = "区域等级"
L["Zoom right in on a cave, mine or crypt, or a dungeon's entrance area, and its map surfaces from underground: Blizzard's own where it drew one, else the game's minimap of it. Over one, the zoom goes on past the deepest zoom."] = "将洞穴、矿洞、墓穴或地下城入口一带放大到最大，其地下的地图就会浮现出来：有暴雪绘制的地图就用它，否则用游戏的小地图。在其上方可放大到超过最大缩放。"
L["Zoomed right out, the world map lies on an ocean that fills the window, in a border: the sea, compass roses, sea creatures, ships and the frame round it painted by Santiago Reyes (used with his permission), laid out for the window's shape, wide or tall. The game's own map stays in the middle. Off: no border."] = "缩到最远时，世界地图铺在一片占满窗口的海洋上，四周围着边框：海洋、罗盘、海怪、船只和边框由Santiago Reyes绘制（经其许可使用），并按窗口的形状排布，无论宽窄。游戏自己的地图仍在中间。关闭：没有边框。"
